sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Worker App (1,000 concurrent users)
    participant API as Shift Service
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    
    Note over Redis: Redis is empty (Cold Start)
    
    App->>API: GET /shifts (User 1)
    API->>Redis: GEOSEARCH
    Redis-->>API: Empty []
    API->>API: Trigger rebuildGeospatialCache()
    Note over API: Acquires Redlock. Queries DB. Bulk inserts to Redis.
    API-->>App: 200 OK [] (Empty list)
    
    App->>API: GET /shifts (Users 2-1000)
    API->>Redis: GEOSEARCH
    Redis-->>API: Empty []
    API->>API: Trigger rebuildGeospatialCache()
    Note over API: Redlock Acquisition Fails. Waits 500ms.
    API-->>App: 200 OK [] (Empty list)
    
    Note over API: Cache rebuild finishes successfully. Redis is warm.
    
    App->>API: GET /shifts (User 1001)
    API->>Redis: GEOSEARCH
    Redis-->>API: [Shift1, Shift2... Shift50]
    API-->>App: 200 OK [Shifts]
